      "contract": "RegisterStateDriver(frame,state,values) bridges to RegisterAttributeDriver(frame,'state-'..state,values). Native state-visibility accepts show/hide and runs frame Show/Hide. Built-in manager listens to both combat transitions. Install and remove registrations outside combat; no addon-created per-frame combat poll required.",
