        538,
        614
      ],
      "contract": "Restricted handles expose Show/Hide/SetParent/SetPoint/ClearBindings. Header-controlled OnHide wrapper can Hide its opted-in popup and clear override bindings through the popup control handle. Referenced frames must satisfy actual handle/protection checks; source alone does not certify runtime permission."
    },
    {
      "owner": "wow-api-widget",
      "path": "Interface/AddOns/Blizzard_APIDocumentationGenerated/SimpleScriptRegionResizingAPIDocumentation.lua",
      "contract": "SetPoint(point:FramePoint,relativeTo:ScriptRegion,relativePoint:FramePoint,offsetX:uiUnit,offsetY:uiUnit) is protected. Retail/Forever additionally check forbidden layout inheritance and annotate secret arguments AllowedWhenUntainted; Classic lacks these annotations."
    },
    {
      "owner": "wow-api-widget",
      "path": "Interface/AddOns/Blizzard_APIDocumentationGenerated/SimpleScriptRegionAPIDocumentation.lua",
      "contract": "SetParent(parent:SimpleFrame or nil) is protected. Retail/Forever CheckAllowChangeParent and secret-argument NotAllowed annotations apply. Settings/relayout/reparent work must stay outside combat."
    },
    {
      "owner": "wow-api-map-navigation / native UI",
      "contract": "Retail and Forever MinimapCluster and ObjectiveTrackerFrame inherit EditMode/managed-layout templates. Use existing Flux positioning owners to reserve right-side width; do not secure-parent Blizzard trackers into button visibility root or move them during combat. Classic progression minimap TOC selects Classic/Minimap.xml; no modern ObjectiveTracker addon was found in its pinned tree."
    }
